{# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   zaza-description.njk — the product Description tab.
   Now shows the FULL feature list (relocated here from
   zaza-product-block.njk) instead of the old short accordion.
   Styling: .zz-fl* + .zz-eyebrow/.zz-h2 are defined globally by
   zaza-product-block.njk's <style> block (which still renders on this
   page). A .zzd-scoped override in that same block stacks the
   categories so they fit this narrower column. .zzd__watch / .zzd__foot
   styles live in components/product-page.njk.
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}

{% if product.description|length > 0 %}
<div class="zzd__intro pp-editor editor">{{ product.description | safe }}</div>
{% endif %}

<p class="zz-eyebrow">// FULL FEATURE LIST</p>
{#— h2, not h3: this is a top-level section under the product's h1, and it
    was the only thing breaking the product page's heading order. The .zz-h2
    class already carries the size, so nothing moves. —#}
<h2 class="zz-h2">Everything in the build, spelled out</h2>
<div class="zz-fl">

  <div class="zz-fl__cat">
